      "statement": "The Gate-12 emissivity budget sustains ionization only up to n_e ~ 5e2-2e7 n_b0 depending on (xi, f_esc).  The trough is neutral iff its mean density exceeds that bound \u2014 the trough is the collapsed/absorber phase and the wing the diffuse phase.  The Step-14 morphology is then the generic two-phase medium, not a tuned profile."
    },
    "assessment": "Coupled attenuation + local photoionization balance solved through the front.  The wing's ionizing field is extinguished within ~24 LyC e-folds, ~6.4 Mpc at diffuse density \u2014 ~1e-09 of the trough depth \u2014 and thinner at absorber densities.  The ~4e+10 Gamma contrast between wing and trough is supplied by self-shielding; the sharp boundary in the Step-14 profile is a consequence, not an assumption.",
