    "statement": "Compton equilibrium of a Planckian bath is T_gas = T_bath (stationary Kompaneets point).  At the thermalization edge U_rad = 0.57 erg/cm3, per-electron coupling time 0.86 yr, so wall gas at x_e ~ 0.9 equilibrates in ~1 yr and even the x_e = 1e-5 trough couples in ~2e6 yr.  Radiation dominates gas thermal energy by ~1e16.  The wall temperature T = 2946 K is therefore derived \u2014 conditional only on the Gate-11B bath that defines the edge \u2014 and the Step-16 Saha grid x_e = 0.83-0.99 is no longer a free assumption.",
