  "verdict": "Four Step-16/17 open items closed at toy-model level: (A) the wing->trough Gamma contrast is supplied by self-shielding over ~24 LyC e-folds (~6 Mpc at diffuse density, ~1e-9 of the trough depth) \u2014 the sharp edge is automatic; (B) the wall gas temperature is derived: Compton equilibrium with the Gate-11B bath sets T_gas = T_bath = 2946 K on ~1 yr, so Saha ionization x_e ~ 0.83-0.99 is no longer conditional on an assumed temperature; (C) the broad visibility tail is a closure artifact provided the edge is genuinely absorptive: the post-edge weight is 0.368 x 11/(11+kappa) \u2014 wall dominance (~88%) is restored for kappa >> ~100/L0, the condition that the boundary thermalizes rather than reddens; the foreground screen is damping e^{-2 tau_fg} ~ 0.85 versus the standard 0.90; (D) the neutrino channel's irradiated mass fraction is bounded under a stated homologous-collapse model \u2014 transit exposure beats static for bursts ~t_ff \u2014 while ejecta identity remains undetermined; (E) reservoir longevity is a ~1e3-1e4 Gyr sequestration requirement, viable only for permanently astration-exempt sites.  The remaining open item in this sector is the perturbation mode spectrum (eternal-native Boltzmann treatment)."
